scriptdefs
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_RandomBerryGirl
lock
faceplayer
dotimebasedevents
goto_if_set FLAG_DAILY_FLOWER_SHOP_RECEIVED_BERRY Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_AlreadyReceivedBerry
msgbox	I'm trying to be like my big sisters. I'm growing flowers, too!Here you go! It's for you!
random 8
addvar VAR_RESULT FIRST_BERRY_INDEX
giveitem VAR_RESULT
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT 0 Common_EventScript_ShowBagIsFull
setflag FLAG_DAILY_FLOWER_SHOP_RECEIVED_BERRY
msgbox	You can plant a BERRY and grow it big, or you can make a POKéMON hold it.But now they have a machine that mixes up different BERRIES and makes candies for POKéMON.I want some candy, too.
release
end
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_AlreadyReceivedBerry
msgbox	You can plant a BERRY and grow it big, or you can make a POKéMON hold it.But now they have a machine that mixes up different BERRIES and makes candies for POKéMON.I want some candy, too.
release
end
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_WailmerPailGirl
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_unset FLAG_RECEIVED_WAILMER_PAIL Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_GiveWailmerPail
msgbox	While BERRY plants are growing, water them with the WAILMER PAIL.Oh, another thing.If you don't pick BERRIES for a while, they'll drop off onto the ground. But they'll sprout again.Isn't that awesome? It's like they have the will to live.
release
end
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_GiveWailmerPail
msgbox	Hello!The more attention you give to flowers, the more beautifully they bloom.You'll like tending flowers. I'm sure of it. You can have this.
giveitem ITEM_WAILMER_PAIL
msgbox	While BERRY plants are growing, water them with the WAILMER PAIL.Oh, another thing.If you don't pick BERRIES for a while, they'll drop off onto the ground. But they'll sprout again.Isn't that awesome? It's like they have the will to live.
setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_WAILMER_PAIL
release
end
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_ShopOwner
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_TEMP_1 Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_SellDecorations
msgbox	Hello!This is the PRETTY PETAL flower shop. Spreading flowers all over the world!
goto_if_set FLAG_MET_PRETTY_PETAL_SHOP_OWNER Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_AlreadyMet
setflag FLAG_MET_PRETTY_PETAL_SHOP_OWNER
msgboxyesno	Your name is?PLAYER. That's a nice name.PLAYER, would you like to learn about BERRIES?
call_if_eq VAR_RESULT YES Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_ExplainBerries
call_if_eq VAR_RESULT NO Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_DontExplainBerries
release
end
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_DontExplainBerries
msgbox	Flowers bring so much happiness to people, don't they?
return
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_ExplainBerries
msgbox	BERRIES grow on trees that thrive only in soft, loamy soil.If you take some BERRIES, be sure to plant one in the loamy soil again.A planted BERRY will soon sprout, grow into a plant, flower beautifully, then grow BERRIES again.I want to see the whole wide world filled with beautiful flowers. That's my dream.Please help me, PLAYER. Plant BERRIES and bring more flowers into the world.
return
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_AlreadyMet
msgboxyesno	PLAYER, would you like to learn about BERRIES?
call_if_eq VAR_RESULT YES Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_ExplainBerries
call_if_eq VAR_RESULT NO Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_DontExplainBerries
release
end
= Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_EventScript_SellDecorations
msgbox	PLAYER, welcome!What can I do for you?
waitmessage
pokemartdecoration2 Route104_PrettyPetalFlowerShop_Pokemart_Plants
msgbox	Please come again!
release
end
